# $Id:

After that you can use the font with Aterm like this:

Aterm*font:                 ter-124b

or in Eterm in your config like this:

begin attributes
    font default 4
    font 1       ter-114b
    font 2       ter-116b
    font 3       ter-120b
    font 4       ter-124b
    font 5       ter-128n
    font fx      br grey25
end attributes
